  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">ECU-N4H Integrated Surveillance of the Human-Animal-Environment Interface under Intersectoral Coordination Mechanisms</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">This project seeks to strengthen Ecuador&#x2019;s capacity for upstream prevention of zoonotic diseases through fourinterventions: 1) improving understanding of the links between biodiversity loss, climate change, and health; 2)operationalizing nature-based solutions; 3) establishing a specialized wildlife surveillance system within theMinistry of Environment and Energy (MAE) and 4) establishing an integrated epidemiological surveillance systemcoordinated among MAE, the Ministry of Public Health (MSP),</narrative>
  </description>
